      "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@128159",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING JOHN.\nIs this Ascension-day? Did not the prophet\nSay that before Ascension-day at noon\nMy crown I should give off? Even so I have.\nI did suppose it should be on constraint;\nBut, heaven be thank’d, it is but voluntary.",
