    {
      "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129191",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING JOHN.\nThat villain Hubert told me he did live.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129191/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129191/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2981472,
        "end": 2981553,
        "line": 107983,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap16/p@129191",
        "anchor": "sceneV_16.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KING JOHN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129276",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BASTARD.\nSo, on my soul, he did, for aught he knew.\nBut wherefore do you droop? Why look you sad?\nBe great in act, as you have been in thought;\nLet not the world see fear and sad distrust\nGovern the motion of a kingly eye.\nBe stirring as the time; be fire with fire;\nThreaten the threat’ner, and outface the brow\nOf bragging horror. So shall inferior eyes,\nThat borrow their behaviours from the great,\nGrow great by your example and put on\nThe dauntless spirit of resolution.\nAway, and glister like the god of war\nWhen he intendeth to become the field.\nShow boldness and aspiring confidence.\nWhat, shall they seek the lion in his den,\nAnd fright him there? And make him tremble there?\nO, let it not be said! Forage, and run\nTo meet displeasure farther from the doors,\nAnd grapple with him ere he come so nigh.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129276/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129276/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "king-john/sceneV_16.1/p@129276/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 97,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
